:null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5580297?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tannerlinsley","id":5580297,"login":"tannerlinsley","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODAyOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tannerlinsley","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/commit/985175de417b77649d73bd64f7c9af4f3fd46921","node_id":"C_kwDOSteFrdoAKDk4NTE3NWRlNDE3Yjc3NjQ5ZDczYmQ2NGY3YzlhZjRmM2ZkNDY5MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/commit/85e89d2678ca4ca7e2737b79b6b4ddb3b2aa3623","sha":"85e89d2678ca4ca7e2737b79b6b4ddb3b2aa3623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/commits/85e89d2678ca4ca7e2737b79b6b4ddb3b2aa3623"}],"sha":"985175de417b77649d73bd64f7c9af4f3fd46921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/commits/985175de417b77649d73bd64f7c9af4f3fd46921"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22392?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jherr","id":22392,"login":"jherr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jherr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/commits/85e89d2678ca4ca7e2737b79b6b4ddb3b2aa3623/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-06T00:18:58Z","email":"jherr@pobox.com","name":"Jack Herrington"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-06T00:18:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Prisma support (#190)\n\n* feat: add configurable add-on options system\n\n- Add Zod schemas for add-on option definitions\n- Support conditional file generation with EJS templates\n- Enable package.json.ejs for conditional dependencies\n- Implement filename prefix stripping for database-specific files\n- Create Drizzle add-on with database provider option\n\n* no optional path to drizzle db location\n\n* feat: improve add-on options UI with settings dialog\n\n- Move add-on configuration from inline display to dedicated dialog\n- Add settings button (gear icon) next to info icon for configurable add-ons\n- Create new AddOnConfigDialog component with proper modal interface\n- Fix reactive state subscription for add-on options in sidebar\n- Clean up sidebar layout by removing inline configuration clutter\n- Add proper default option initialization when add-ons are toggled\n- Export add-on option types from engine for better type safety\n\nImproves UX by providing dedicated space for configuration with clear\ncontext while keeping the sidebar clean and compact.\n\n* cli in interactive mode asks for option values\n\n* feat: add add-on discovery and configuration CLI options\n\n- Enhanced --list-add-ons to show * for configurable add-ons\n- Added --addon-details command to show comprehensive add-on information\n- Added --add-on-config option for non-interactive configuration\n- Supports discovering options, dependencies, routes, and all add-on metadata\n\n* test: add comprehensive unit tests for add-on options system\n\nImplements Phase 4 testing for the add-on options system with comprehensive unit test coverage:\n\n- add-on-options.test.ts: Zod schema validation, default population, and error handling (15 tests)\n- template-context.test.ts: EJS template context with addOnOption variable integration (12 tests)\n- filename-processing.test.ts: Prefix stripping logic for __prefix__filename patterns (11 tests)\n- conditional-packages.test.ts: EJS conditional package.json processing (11 tests)\n\nKey test coverage areas:\n- Option schema validation with comprehensive positive/negative cases\n- Template variable integration and conditional file processing\n- Filename prefix stripping (__option__filename.ext.ejs → filename.ext)\n- Conditional package dependency generation via EJS templates\n- Error handling for malformed options and templates\n\nAll 49 new tests pass, ensuring robust validation of the add-on options functionality.\n\n* docs: add comprehensive add-on options documentation\n\n- Document configuration format and option types in info.json\n- Explain template usage with addOnOption variables\n- Cover conditional file naming conventions with prefixes\n- Provide complete examples for both React CRA and Solid frameworks\n- Include CLI usage patterns for interactive and non-interactive modes\n- Add best practices for add-on developers\n\n* add addon options to the mcp\n\n* switch to prisma\n\n* feat: add post-init script support for add-ons\n\n- Add postInitScript field to add-on info schema\n- Implement post-init script execution in special steps\n- Update Prisma add-on with database initialization script\n- Add comprehensive tests for post-init script functionality\n- Handle script execution after package installation\n- Fix bun package manager test expectation\n\n* watch the cli''s for changes with pnpm dev\n\n* split out prisma into two add-ons\n\n* feat: prisma updates and fixups\n\n* fix: small ui fix\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: timoconnellaus <tim.oconnell.australia@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"40ebb5d8c4e67fd818a9abd7fc289e1679a6e609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/git/trees/40ebb5d8c4e67fd818a9abd7fc289e1679a6e609"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weiflycc-cmd/create-tsrouter-app/git/commits/85e89d2678ca4ca7e2737b79b6b4ddb3b2aa3623","verification":{"payload":"tree 40ebb5d8c4e67fd818a9abd7fc289e1679a6e609\nparent 276b96bbbd5cdd6813cf472df961123829f3ee0d\nauthor Jack Herrington <jherr@pobox.com> 1759709938 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1759709938 -0700\n\nfeat: Prisma support (#190)\n\n* feat: add configurable add-on options system\n\n- Add Zod schemas for add-on option definitions\n- Support conditional file generation with EJS templates\n- Enable package.json.ejs for conditional dependencies\n- Implement filename prefix stripping for database-specific files\n- Create Drizzle add-on with database provider option\n\n* no optional path to drizzle db location\n\n* feat: improve add-on options UI with settings dialog\n\n- Move add-on configuration from inline display to dedicated dialog\n- Add settings button (gear icon) next to info icon for configurable add-ons\n- Create new AddOnConfigDialog component with proper modal interface\n- Fix reactive state subscription for add-on options in sidebar\n- Clean up sidebar layout by removing inline configuration clutter\n- Add proper default option initialization when add-ons are toggled\n- Export add-on option types from engine for better type safety\n\nImproves UX by providing dedicated space for configuration with clear\ncontext while keeping the sidebar clean and compact.\n\n* cli in interactive mode asks for option values\n\n* feat: add add-on discovery and configuration CLI options\n\n- Enhanced --list-add-ons to show * for configurable add-ons\n- Added --addon-details command to show comprehensive add-on information\n- Added --add-on-config option for non-interactive configuration\n- Supports discovering options, dependencies, routes, and all add-on metadata\n\n* test: add comprehensive unit tests for add-on options system\n\nImplements Phase 4 testing for the add-on options system with comprehensive unit test coverage:\n\n- add-on-options.test.ts: Zod schema validation, default population, and error handling (15 tests)\n- template-context.test.ts: EJS template context with addOnOption variable integration (12 tests)\n- filename-processing.test.ts: Prefix stripping logic for __prefix__filename patterns (11 tests)\n- conditional-packages.test.ts: EJS conditional package.json processing (11 tests)\n\nKey test coverage areas:\n- Option schema validation with comprehensive positive/negative cases\n- Template variable integration and conditional file processing\n- Filename prefix stripping (__option__filename.ext.ejs → filename.ext)\n- Conditional package dependency generation via EJS templates\n- Error handling for malformed options and templates\n\nAll 49 new tests pass, ensuring robust validation of the add-on options functionality.\n\n* docs: add comprehensive add-on options documentation\n\n- Document configuration format and option types in info.json\n- Explain template usage with addOnOption variables\n- Cover conditional file naming conventions with prefixes\n- Provide complete examples for both React CRA and Solid frameworks\n- Include CLI usage patterns for interactive and non-interactive modes\n- Add best practices for add-on developers\n\n* add addon options to the mcp\n\n* switch to prisma\n\n* feat: add post-init script support for add-ons\n\n- Add postInitScript field to add-on info schema\n- Implement post-init script execution in special steps\n- Update Prisma add-on with database initialization script\n- Add comprehensive tests for post-init script functionality\n- Handle script execution after package installation\n- Fix bun package manager test expectation\n\n* watch the cli''s for changes with pnpm dev\n\n* split out prisma into two add-ons\n\n* feat: prisma updates and fixups\n\n* fix: small ui fix\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: timoconnellaus <tim.oconnell.australia@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo4wryCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASPMQAHcDQ6yh2qLwZa89iyY4dfA5\nD9YRMzj7ZzRSlrvA5SqRXaf4FP2ZfkwQ7Gv4pPSKf530cCxjCVh7OWJhIGXBV4QH\nYd7urEwRQ/iYl/uvew3WUJNSbUIqjZ/Ke9wHJzn3cqpi+ZQ7bbl9qwwhcDsyjnBR\n3pMO3ow4ZwxL2gnbw4CtnGn+x4O1ZU8zlr6v2M0oTSCMVb5Gy8kHBSv9YfA/p2oo\no0xzo1+zRYih3cXIInKbcV07FlH3gs0CEqA56MSXnJruVSCrBTYI+TnQSzs6HKCA\npHTD7rUKwJzJB5qKMzu4RXYMKkmNn4etULwXMv4TFpIQlEfd1GqfgkOvokAAeXts\n/GD/pc0emt0y/B/NyAm9oE6YoCaLSrhVbRKrvolPaHC9hoZSgc+O+S7WnTRN6I6c\nL8IsoKwaQ6zkKPSHgMcTeskf1iyOpXI0qCyep8tPKRwnyWCDqJzNXRoY0zIxTh93\nM1aZQs0gZPL+JIuXeX5lOUFN8T34GwkVGzrzh7s3HEPboylUtpLMvfpp2Qbt117/\nyy5Kzbu9Xp9hSU4dAtZ1AsAaK2WQysA5I0+lF6KOWu4Qw2ZroKi8Qpu4U4f5cESC\nqxAhWkH12fLc+hY83JEG84uEK0HndPpFMFfMhwPWz3vISuBw8NP9duPQwKFR9JSE\nx8cs3hQeBFyzl8z08I85\n=RXIo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-01T06:44:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"logi