","email":"sshtein@redhat.com","name":"Shimon Shtein"},"message":"Fixes #39625 - Enforce unique taxonomy names at the DB level\n\nAdd a unique index on taxonomies(type, COALESCE(ancestry, ''''), lower(name))\nto prevent duplicate taxonomy names at the database level. The migration\nrenames pre-existing duplicates using a name-{id} pattern, rebuilds\ndenormalized titles, and updates lookup value matchers accordingly.\n\nAdd rescue_from ActiveRecord::RecordNotUnique in Api::BaseController to\nreturn 409 Conflict instead of 500 on concurrent duplicate inserts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51e0817a56effd5cb06067a67d50c663018a02c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theforeman/foreman/git/trees/51e0817a56effd5cb06067a67d50c663018a02c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theforeman/foreman/git/commits/c74b70ed8ea3d2fbdb206a636d9c528578eddc01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10046168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShimShtein","id":10046168,"login":"ShimShtein","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ2MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShimShtein","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github