://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/b337fb49457b0f2322918077c0279bfd04a22c0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:04:54Z","email":"patrik.gerzsenyi@instructure.com","name":"patrik.gerzsenyi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:34:40Z","email":"patrik.gerzsenyi@instructure.com","name":"Patrik Gerzsenyi"},"message":"link caption status text to language name via aria-describedby\n\nScreen reader users navigating the caption list now hear\nthe status (Processing/Failed) when focusing a language\nname, satisfying WCAG 1.3.1.\n\nrefs ARC-11503\nflag=rce_asr_captioning_improvements\n\ntest plan:\n- open Caption Manager, trigger auto-captioning\n- verify screen reader announces status with\n  the language name\n- verify no aria-describedby in ready state\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nChange-Id: I27e5e2d9d0ef1b202d16e823de112ac0ca1c8008\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/405975\nReviewed-by: Tamas Jakli <tamas.jakli@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Jozsef Gubicza <jozsef.gubicza@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jozsef Gubicza <jozsef.gubicza@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Patrik Gerzsenyi <patrik.gerzsenyi@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"82e9a0deefcbbc934bb1f1f8d8c6c8e4aa78ae35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/82e9a0deefcbbc934bb1f1f8d8c6c8e4aa78ae35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/b337fb49457b0f2322918077c0279bfd04a22c0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226324363?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/patrikgerzsenyi","id":226324363,"login":"patrikgerzsenyi","node_id":"U_kgDODX1viw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrikgerzsenyi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/b337fb49457b0f2322918077c0279bfd04a22c0a","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKGIzMzdmYjQ5NDU3YjBmMjMyMjkxODA3N2MwMjc5YmZkMDRhMjJjMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a","sha":"6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a"}],"sha":"b337fb49457b0f2322918077c0279bfd04a22c0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/b337fb49457b0f2322918077c0279bfd04a22c0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79874817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hossamg-122","id":79874817,"login":"hossamg-122","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODc0ODE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T00:34:33Z","email":"hossam.ebrahim@instructure.com","name":"hossamg122"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:30:46Z","email":"hossam.ebrahim@instructure.com","name":"Hossam Ebrahim"},"message":"Fix text overlap in rubric InstructorScore label\n\nThe \"Instructor Score\" / \"Peer Review Score\" label in\nthe rubric assessment panel was overflowing and\noverlapping adjacent content when translated into\nlanguages with longer strings (e.g., Norwegian).\n\nWrapped the label in TruncateText so it truncates\ngracefully when space is constrained, and added a\nTooltip that appears on hover only when the text is\nactually truncated, preserving the full label for\naccessibility.\n\nChanges:\n- Import TruncateText and Tooltip components\n- Track truncation state via onUpdate callback\n- Render Tooltip conditionally based on truncation\n- Adjust margin when label is truncated\n\nfixes EVAL-5857\nflag=none\n\nTest plan:\nSetup:\n- Enable a course with peer review assignments\n- Create a rubric and attach it to the assignment\n- Open Canvas in English and in Norwegian\n  (Account Settings > Language)\n\nTesting:\n- In English: verify \"Instructor Score\" label renders\n  normally with no truncation or tooltip\n- Switch language to Norwegian and reopen the rubric\n  assessment panel\n- Verify the label truncates instead of overflowing\n  into adjacent content\n- Hover over the truncated label and verify a tooltip\n  appears showing the full translated label text\n- Verify the layout does not shift or break for other\n  rubric elements\n- Repeat for peer review rubric and verify\n  \"Peer Review Score\" behaves the same way\n\nExpected Results:\n- No text overlap in any language\n- Tooltip only appears when label is actually truncated\n- English labels are unaffected and render normally\n- Layout remains stable across both score label types\n\nChange-Id: I1453fcd3192b85ce32c27140f7873e9b0012d664\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407478\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Soto <christopher.soto@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Derek Williams <derek.williams@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Kai Bjorkman <kbjorkman@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Chris Soto <christopher.soto@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jacob DeWar <jacob.dewar@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Cameron Ray <cameron.ray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"eede2f09c1c42fe7216dd289f97e416f6c6bfca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/eede2f09c1c42fe7216dd289f97e416f6c6bfca5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79874817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hossamg-122","id":79874817,"login":"hossamg-122","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODc0ODE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKDZjOWI4OTBhMzY4YzlhNjFhMWExMDJhNDdlMDJkY2M1OGNjZTk5OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/d7328a4e35e3c2511e92201201a7f0ff667b5385","sha":"d7328a4e35e3c2511e92201201a7f0ff667b5385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/d7328a4e35e3c2511e92201201a7f0ff667b5385"}],"sha":"6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/6c9b890a368c9a61a1a102a47e02dcc58cce998a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48316403?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gazuru","id":48316403,"login":"Gazuru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzE2NDAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/d7328a4e35e3c2511e92201201a7f0ff667b5385/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T08:38:31Z","email":"gabor.gonda@instructure.com","name":"Gábor Gonda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:04:26Z","email":"gabor.gonda@instructure.com","name":"Gábor Gonda"},"message":"Fix courseProgression null in multi-course query\n\nUser.courseProgression returned null when queried via\nenrollments → course → usersConnection across more\nthan one course. Move context.scoped_merge!(course:)\nout of the preload_course_permissions.then block so\nits scoped path is attributed to the resolver, not\nthe deferred batch flush.\n\nfixes LX-4162\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- as a learner enrolled in 2+ module-based courses\n  with completion requirements, run the multi-course\n  GraphQL query from the ticket\n- verify courseProgression.requirements is populated\n  for every course (not null)\n- single-course query still returns progression\n- REST progress endpoint still works\n\nChange-Id: Iadd785788e6c6e153a5067fc1e2973c2e31b0fe6\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407576\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Sarah Gerard <sarah.gerard@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Sarah Gerard <sarah.gerard@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Sarah Gerard <sarah.gerard@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"342fbb049ee45251d03a4847778cf3e3cf48c156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/342fbb049ee45251d03a4847778cf3e3cf48c156"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/d7328a4e35e3c2511e92201201a7f0ff667b5385","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48316403?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gazuru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"