thor":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/c4f6a972eb83c71838bcc65a2ee38c01e6c7c597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T09:33:32Z","email":"peipei.zhou@instructure.com","name":"Peipei Zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:13:32Z","email":"peipei.zhou@instructure.com","name":"Peipei Zhou"},"message":"Render gradebook view directly instead of redirect\n\nWhen switching to LMGB via ?view=learning_mastery, render\nthe correct template directly instead of redirecting to\n/gradebook. The redirect + re-read pattern was unreliable:\nif the DB read in the second request returned stale data\n(e.g., read replica lag), Traditional Gradebook would show\ninstead of LMGB.\n\nfixes OUTC-784\nflag=outcomes_gradebook\n\ntest plan:\n- Go to Traditional Gradebook for a course\n- Open the gradebook dropdown menu\n- Click \"Learning Mastery Gradebook\"\n- Verify LMGB loads consistently (no intermittent\n  Traditional Gradebook reload)\n\nChange-Id: I0eada5c063c3f40bc789b1ce95059f71d705118c\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407516\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Balázs Buri <balazs.buri@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Balázs Buri <balazs.buri@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Sam Garza <sam.garza@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"15fde4811a33befd02891207edae243071516efb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/15fde4811a33befd02891207edae243071516efb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/c4f6a972eb83c71838bcc65a2ee38c01e6c7c597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/c4f6a972eb83c71838bcc65a2ee38c01e6c7c597","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKGM0ZjZhOTcyZWI4M2M3MTgzOGJjYzY1YTJlZTM4YzAxZTZjN2M1OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9","sha":"726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9"}],"sha":"c4f6a972eb83c71838bcc65a2ee38c01e6c7c597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/c4f6a972eb83c71838bcc65a2ee38c01e6c7c597"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T06:47:39Z","email":"peipei.zhou@instructure.com","name":"Peipei Zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T07:54:45Z","email":"peipei.zhou@instructure.com","name":"Peipei Zhou"},"message":"Fix duplicate expand buttons on bar chart\n\nHover state should be driven by actual cursor\nposition, not per-cell enter/leave events which\nbrowsers drop on fast movement.\n\nfixes OUTC-783\nflag=improved_lmgb\n\ntest plan:\n- open Learning Mastery Gradebook\n- sweep cursor quickly across multiple\n  outcome bar charts\n- verify only one expand button is visible\n  at any time\n- click expand and confirm the popover\n  still opens correctly\n\nChange-Id: Id679125072712e26331d6e9aae1c7fea28401669\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407488\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Balázs Buri <balazs.buri@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Balázs Buri <balazs.buri@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Sam Garza <sam.garza@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb8c5793baa9b8ca6ed190a2396848da55d7c246","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/bb8c5793baa9b8ca6ed190a2396848da55d7c246"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKDcyNmFhMTZkODYxNjlkYzU5N2U4ZTY4YTczOTE1Y2IzMzAyY2YxYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/a5c577f5148cabfbea3ab498d793602b43820b88","sha":"a5c577f5148cabfbea3ab498d793602b43820b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/a5c577f5148cabfbea3ab498d793602b43820b88"}],"sha":"726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/726aa16d86169dc597e8e68a73915cb3302cf1c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128488614?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/david-hajnal","id":128488614,"login":"david-hajnal","node_id":"U_kgDOB6iUpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/a5c577f5148cabfbea3ab498d793602b43820b88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:46:22Z","email":"david.hajnal@instructure.com","name":"David Hajnal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T06:56:47Z","email":"david.hajnal@instructure.com","name":"David Hajnal"},"message":"add cascade-restore indexes for institutional tags\n\n  Cascade-restore queries filter by workflow_state=''deleted''\n  and updated_at to find rows archived in the same operation.\n  Without partial composite indexes these scans grow with\n  total deleted rows. Add postdeploy partial indexes on\n  (institutional_tag_id, updated_at) and\n  (category_id, updated_at) to keep restore O(matched rows).\n\n  refs IMP-7422\n  flag=none\n\n  test plan:\n  - run db:migrate; verify both indexes exist\n  - archive a category with tags + associations\n  - restore the category; confirm cascade restores\n    associated tags and associations\n  - EXPLAIN cascade_restore_associations_for query uses\n    idx_inst_tag_assoc_tag_archived_updated_at\n\nChange-Id: If678db8dc0f1455bad4b61c90ef5d0512d4ece88\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407569\nReviewed-by: Norbert György <norbert.gyorgy@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Cody Cutrer <cody@instructure.com>\nMigration-Review: Cody Cutrer <cody@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: David Hajnal <david.hajnal@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: David Hajnal <david.hajnal@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"29017da7945190516de251e5c5dd2a398d277384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/29017da7945190516de251e5c5dd2a398d277384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/a5c577f5148cabfbea3ab498d793602b43820b88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128488614?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david-hajnal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/david-hajn