was a POC.\nit will be reintroduced when PM comes up\nwith new Analysis AC\n\ntest plan:\n- jenkins passes\n- see demo video in ticket\n(it should give you a general idea of\nwhat to test)\n\nChange-Id: I1a34d2b1c7c0608df4c859d374cdb871e9bee766\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407602\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Caleb Guanzon <cguanzon@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"e258f3f386b592102dbf75191426c4f7927ea083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/e258f3f386b592102dbf75191426c4f7927ea083"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/dec5418eb4c5b0edb5815f8c3b23d18d268ab439","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4731070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cguanzon","id":4731070,"login":"cguanzon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzEwNzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/dec5418eb4c5b0edb5815f8c3b23d18d268ab439","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKGRlYzU0MThlYjRjNWIwZWRiNTgxNWY4YzNiMjNkMThkMjY4YWI0Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e","sha":"50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e"}],"sha":"dec5418eb4c5b0edb5815f8c3b23d18d268ab439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/dec5418eb4c5b0edb5815f8c3b23d18d268ab439"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2695753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chanoto89","id":2695753,"login":"chanoto89","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTU3NTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T20:57:59Z","email":"christopher.soto@instructure.com","name":"Chris Soto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T20:32:57Z","email":"christopher.soto@instructure.com","name":"Chris Soto"},"message":"refactor rubric form nested tables & gen criteria\n\nthis commit refactors the rubric form to not use nested tables in the\ncriteria container. it will instead be seperate sections with headers\nfor each criteria. it also fixes the display and responsiveness of the\nGenerate Criteria buttons so that they display correctly and wrap\nresponsively on smaller screens.\n\nfixes EVAL-6753\nfixes EVAL-6755\nflag=enhanced_rubrics\n\ntest plan:\n- open the rubric form page and add a criteria, an outcome criteria,\n  and a couple AI generated criteria.\n- verify that the criteria are all displayed correctly\n- make the criteria responsive down to 320px and verify that they are\n  still displayed correctly\n- verify that the GeneratedCriteriaHeader component renders properly and\n  that the contents of the header wrap responsively as well.\n- verify that the Generate Criteria button for an individual criterion\n  is displayed correctly and becomes added to the action menu for that\n  criterion when the viewport is under 550px\n- verify that both Generate Criteria buttons correctly open and close\n  the RegenerateCriteriaModal and that the modal closes correctly when\n  cancelling or regenerating criteria.\n\nChange-Id: I6302148ee5bceca41e16664fc1ed7dbe9f06e114\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/405700\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Derek Williams <derek.williams@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: László Sipula <laszlo.sipula@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: László Sipula <laszlo.sipula@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Cameron Ray <cameron.ray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6d111d956baed2b5092ea0ed7d11dd138e4b9d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/f6d111d956baed2b5092ea0ed7d11dd138e4b9d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2695753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chanoto89","id":2695753,"login":"chanoto89","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTU3NTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chanoto89","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKDUwNTE4Y2FkNjhkZjMyMGE5ODYwZWVmYjljZWIxNGFjNjRlZmRkMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865","sha":"50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865"}],"sha":"50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/50518cad68df320a9860eefb9ceb14ac64efdd1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T19:03:12Z","email":"mahema.singh@instructure.com","name":"Mahema Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T20:12:00Z","email":"mahema.singh@instructure.com","name":"Mahema Singh"},"message":"Add aria-label to peer review icon\n\nAdds accessible label to IconPeerReviewLine so\nscreen readers can identify the icon in the\nstudent peer reviews list.\n\ncloses EGG-2375\nflag=peer_review_allocation_and_grading\n\nQA: https://instructure.atlassian.net/browse/EGG-2375?focusedCommentId=2912334\n\ntest plan:\n- Navigate to an assignment with peer reviews\n- Open student view and check the peer reviews\n  section\n- Inspect the HTML via the dev tools and verify that the SVG has the aria-label \"Peer Review\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nChange-Id: Id1fcd277c5ce026a2d8ee07a70fd8e4c7bcf36ce\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407626\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Martin Yosifov <martin.yosifov@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Martin Yosifov <martin.yosifov@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Angela Gomba <angela.gomba@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7a13a0fd18de6f6f58f997546e6790c62ef5492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/d7a13a0fd18de6f6f58f997546e6790c62ef5492"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKDUwYmNiYWEyNDM5OGZhYmQxOTk0ZjRmZjdhYjEyMmIwNWUzY2Y4NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/57941aa7001b7fc1b852bd356b8c9fd8c28634a7","sha":"57941aa7001b7fc1b852bd356b8c9fd8c28634a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/57941aa7001b7fc1b852bd356b8c9fd8c28634a7"}],"sha":"50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/50bcbaa24398fabd1994f4ff7ab122b05e3cf865"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6925979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spencerolson","id":6925979,"login":"spencerolson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MjU5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/57941aa7001b7fc1b852bd356b8c9fd8c28634a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T19:59:39Z","email":"solson@instructure.com","name":"Spencer Olson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T17:50:25Z","email":"solson@instructure.com","name":"Spencer Olson"},"message":"stop deleting past attachment associations\n\nWhen a student submits a new attempt on an assignment, we want to keep\nthe AttachmentAssociations from previous attempts around. This moves us\ntowards a future where we use AttachmentAssociation-based auth checks\nto determine if a submission is associated with an attachment.\n\nNote that this change does not impact the returned attachments from\nSubmission#attachments. That will continue to only return attachments\nfrom the most recent attempt.\n\ncloses GROW-234\nflag=none\n\n[fsc-timeout=75]\n[fsc-node-count=10]\n\nTest Plan 1:\n1. turn OFF \"Assignment Enhancements - Student\"\n2. create a file upload assignment\n3. submit File A as a student. then submit again, but submit File B.\n4. Go to /courses/:id/assignments/:assignment_id for the assignment,\n   as the student\n5. Notice you only see a \"Download File B\" link in the sidebar, not a\n   \"Download File A\" link.\n\nTest Plan 2:\n1. create a file upload assignment\n2. submit File A as a student. then submit again, but submit File B.\n3. Go to /graphiql as a site admin user\n4. Make sure the following request only returns File B\n\nquery MyQuery {\n  submission(\n    userId: <the student id>,\n    assignmentId: <the assignment id>\n  ) {\n    attachments {\n      displayName\n      _id\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nChange-Id: Ibc15fb29f9b3fa26594b4785c852eaf0b442122a\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/405710\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Rajmund Csehil <rajmund.csehil@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Rajmund Csehil <rajmund.csehil@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Cameron Ray <cameron.ray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"732e430f9420101be7213414210240c020103bf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/732e430f9420101be7213414210240c020103bf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/57941aa7001b7fc1b852bd356b8c9fd8c28634a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6925979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/spencerolson","id":6925979,"login":"spencerolson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MjU5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spencerolson/repos","site_admin":fals