e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/679c8d41af4bd4e0072f2ad3587efa1befa07fcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T14:37:05Z","email":"derek.williams@instructure.com","name":"Derek Williams"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T17:21:30Z","email":"derek.williams@instructure.com","name":"Derek Williams"},"message":"show letter grade when scored is zero\n\nif a grade was zero, it was displayed as a dash in\nthe individual gradebook\n\ncloses EVAL-6516\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- set up an assignment to use a grading scheme\n  -- ensure 0% is covered in the scheme\n- grade that assignment as a zero\n- verify that the letter grade is displayed correctly\nin the Student Information section of the individual gradebook\n\nChange-Id: Ief85b7bdf38ed9ace698680b34308e56b9a6156d\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/406325\nReviewed-by: Chris Soto <christopher.soto@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Spencer Olson <solson@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Derek Williams <derek.williams@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Yasi Afsharnive <yasaman.afsharnive@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d383eb49693be7ee6a440c4b6f4bddc4eae2db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/3d383eb49693be7ee6a440c4b6f4bddc4eae2db1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/679c8d41af4bd4e0072f2ad3587efa1befa07fcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41767875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwilli77","id":41767875,"login":"dwilli77","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzY3ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/679c8d41af4bd4e0072f2ad3587efa1befa07fcc","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKDY3OWM4ZDQxYWY0YmQ0ZTAwNzJmMmFkMzU4N2VmYTFiZWZhMDdmY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/e9bcddcf3bf0e5b2132b97a33fd3fddfdfa15aff","sha":"e9bcddcf3bf0e5b2132b97a33fd3fddfdfa15aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/e9bcddcf3bf0e5b2132b97a33fd3fddfdfa15aff"}],"sha":"679c8d41af4bd4e0072f2ad3587efa1befa07fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/679c8d41af4bd4e0072f2ad3587efa1befa07fcc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41767875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwilli77","id":41767875,"login":"dwilli77","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzY3ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/e9bcddcf3bf0e5b2132b97a33fd3fddfdfa15aff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T13:44:06Z","email":"derek.williams@instructure.com","name":"Derek Williams"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T17:21:14Z","email":"derek.williams@instructure.com","name":"Derek Williams"},"message":"Sanitize auto-grade error messages shown to users\n\nGraderErrors were displayed directly to users in the\nauto_grade_orchestration flow, but the grade_service\nwas wrapping all errors — including internal Ruby errors\nand verbose Cedar API responses — as GraderErrors. This\ncaused technical stack traces and internal details to\nleak to users.\n\nNow only known-safe Cedar error subclasses surface their\nmessages to users, mapped to grading-specific copy.\nThe base CedarClientError and all unexpected errors log\ntheir details and raise a generic user-safe message.\nThe criteria mismatch error likewise logs its count\ndetails instead of exposing them.\n\nrefs EVAL-6799\nflag=project_lhotse\n\ntest plan:\nSetup:\n- Set up a course with an assignment, rubric,\n  and a student submission eligible for auto-grading\n\nTesting:\n- Trigger auto-grading on a submission that exceeds\n  the Cedar content length limit and verify the user\n  sees \"The submission is too long to be graded\n  automatically.\" rather than a raw Cedar message\n- Trigger auto-grading when Cedar''s rate limit is\n  hit and verify \"Grading is temporarily unavailable.\n  Please try again later.\"\n- Simulate a Cedar API error that doesn''t match a\n  known subclass and verify the user sees a generic\n  message, not internal Cedar API details\n\nChange-Id: If349e5a07f0104b6a535cf1f512d0e06da44c6fe\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/406489\nReviewed-by: Rajmund Csehil <rajmund.csehil@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Soto <christopher.soto@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Chris Soto <christopher.soto@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Yasi Afsharnive <yasaman.afsharnive@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"47aae9193f23a1131620d9fe1878cc26d420d6b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/47aae9193f23a1131620d9fe1878cc26d420d6b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/e9bcddcf3bf0e5b2132b97a33fd3fddfdfa15aff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41767875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwilli77","id":41767875,"login":"dwilli77","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzY3ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwilli77","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/e9bcddcf3bf0e5b2132b97a33fd3fddfdfa15aff","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKGU5YmNkZGNmM2JmMGU1YjIxMzJiOTdhMzNmZDNmZGRmZGZhMTVhZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/6e669b207080d3b3f134a0e8b1b267c8cd1d5bb2","sha":"6e669b