n":"smcgee31","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQxNDE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smcgee31/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smcgee31/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smcgee31/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smcgee31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smcgee31/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smcgee31","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/91a432cc10da827ad10faa42816a44d1aa844e58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T18:13:48Z","email":"steve.mcgee@instructure.com","name":"Steve McGee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T14:36:11Z","email":"steve.mcgee@instructure.com","name":"Steven McGee"},"message":"Add access token expiration reminder email\n\nUsers have no warning before their user-generated access tokens\nexpire, causing integrations to break unexpectedly. This sends an\nemail 7 days before expiration so they can generate a new token in time.\n\ncloses INTEROP-10389\nflag=access_key_expiration_email\n\ntest plan:\n- Enable the `access_key_expiration_email` flag in Site Admin FF\n- Create a user-generated access token and set its expiration to\n  7 days from now via rails console\n- Run `AccessToken.send_expiration_reminders` in the rails console\n- Verify the user receives an email containing their name, expiration\n  date, app name, and purpose\n- Verify a link to user settings is included\n\nChange-Id: Ia6a4fb8741c6fb5105bff599ff1759a711cacb86\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/406976\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nMigration-Review: Isaac Moore <isaac.moore@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Ryan Hawkins <ryan.hawkins@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Ryan Hawkins <ryan.hawkins@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Steven McGee <steve.mcgee@instruc