_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moe-hajjaj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moe-hajjaj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moe-hajjaj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/51a23acb8cd41c1483e911fa58260ccd446496cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T15:35:30Z","email":"mohammad.hajjaj@instructure.com","name":"mohammad.hajjaj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T08:59:12Z","email":"mohammad.hajjaj@instructure.com","name":"Mohammad Hajjaj"},"message":"Fix Item Banks link in non-English locales\n\nThe Item Banks nav tab should route to the\nnative Canvas banks path in any locale when\nthe native experience flag is enabled, not\nto the LTI external tool launch. The match\nin override_item_banks_tab failed because\nupdate_tabs_and_return_item_banks_tab had\nalready translated the label before the\noverride ran.\n\ncloses QUIZ-17731\ncloses QUIZ-17658\nflag=new_quizzes_native_experience\n\ntest plan:\n- enable new_quizzes_account_course_level_item_banks\n  and new_quizzes_native_experience feature flags\n- change account language to a non-English locale\n- clear Redis cache in a Canvas rails console:\n    RedisClient.with_dangerous_redis_methods do\n      Rails.cache.clear\n    end\n- go to a course and click the Item Banks nav link\n- verify it redirects to the native /banks path\n- repeat from the account-level Item Banks nav link\n  and verify the same behavior\n\nChange-Id: I2d063ff756e683d13e40f886acb95097801df8a7\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407057\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Márton Gréczi <marton.greczi@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Márton Gréczi <marton.greczi@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Márton Gréczi <marton.greczi@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6813a2ce7fff38a17ac4df2311c9c3f651877ab","url":"https://api.gi