/avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153002962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-instructure","id":153002962,"login":"jason-instructure","node_id":"U_kgDOCR6j0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/abc9a72b7d7fce659518e6ed0432e1b4caf9c483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T17:55:31Z","email":"jason.anderson@instructure.com","name":"Jason Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T20:54:15Z","email":"jason.anderson@instructure.com","name":"Jason Anderson"},"message":"Add V2 auth token support to LLM Conversation Service\n\ncloses LLMA-332\nflag=ai_experiences\n\n  Accounts with ai_experiences_v2_auth enabled now use\n  account-specific JWT tokens instead of the shared V1\n  bearer token. Tokens are cached in Redis with a 1hr\n  TTL. On 401, the client automatically refreshes using\n  the stored refresh token and retries.\n\n  closes <JIRA issue key>\n  flag=ai_experiences_v2_auth\n\n  test plan:\n  - Enable ai_experiences_v2_auth on an account and\n    provision it, confirm api/refresh tokens saved\n    to account settings\n  - Make an LLM service call, confirm V2 JWT used and\n    Redis key is populated\n  - Expire the api token server-side, confirm the\n    client refreshes transparently and retries\n  - With flag disabled, confirm V1 bearer token is\n    used and no Redis key is written\n\nChange-Id: I26c887efd5496c90b78306a2f520ce0f6345478b\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407107\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Caleb Guanzon <cguanzon@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Caleb Guanzon <cguanzon@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"d24b6c4cca8f80f0f4489fc8f7bc7e5ba08a5d72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/d24b6c4cca8f80f0f4489fc8f7bc7e5ba08a5d72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/abc9a72b7d7fce659518e6ed0432e1b4caf9c483","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153002962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-instructure","id":153002962,"login":"jason-instructure","node_id":"U_kgDOCR6j0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-instructure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/abc9a72b7d7fce659518e6ed0432e1b4caf9c483","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKGFiYzlhNzJiN2Q3ZmNlNjU5NTE4ZTZlZDA0MzJlMWI0Y2FmOWM0ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805","sha":"46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805"}],"sha":"abc9a72b7d7fce659518e6ed0432e1b4caf9c483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/abc9a72b7d7fce659518e6ed0432e1b4caf9c483"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5138892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ericsaupe","id":5138892,"login":"ericsaupe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzg4OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T15:22:30Z","email":"eric.saupe@instructure.com","name":"Eric Saupe"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:04:18Z","email":"eric.saupe@instructure.com","name":"Eric Saupe"},"message":"Add tier_1_visible_on_hook to study_assist flag\n\nIgniteAI Study Tools should be visible for\nCore tier and above. Using tier_1 through\n6/30/2026; may switch to tier_3 after.\n\ncloses CNVS-72329\nflag=study_assist\n\ntest plan:\n- as a site admin, go to the account\n  feature options page\n- verify \"IgniteAI Study Tools\" is listed\n- edit lib/feature_flags/hooks.rb locally\n  so tier_1_visible_on_hook returns false\n- restart the web server and reload page\n- verify \"IgniteAI Study Tools\" is NOT listed\n- restore tier_1_visible_on_hook to true\n- reload page, verify it is listed again\n\nChange-Id: Ia9e77edb44cc1ced62123ae3f4b6a2f02e4e5ff0\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407242\nReviewed-by: Marwan Hasan <marwan.hasan@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a3c47004cd0de86e046307e42f2356b422bd1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/7a3c47004cd0de86e046307e42f2356b422bd1a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5138892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ericsaupe","id":5138892,"login":"ericsaupe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzg4OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericsaupe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKDQ2YWQwYzNmYzZjZDA5OGU0MTQ0ZWE0OWNkMzZkODYyMjdiZjQ4MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/55cf5da502fc945c934d620e2107c2665d6838ed","sha":"55cf5da502fc945c934d620e2107c2665d6838ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/55cf5da502fc945c934d620e2107c2665d6838ed"}],"sha":"46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/46ad0c3fc6cd098e4144ea49cd36d86227bf4805"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf","id":122654,"login":"aaronshaf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjY1NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronshaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/55cf5da502fc945c934d620e2107c2665d6838ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T22:58:41Z","email":"ashafovaloff@instructure.com","name":"Aaron Shafovaloff"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T18:52:07Z","email":"ashafovaloff@instructure.com","name":"Aaron Shafovaloff"},"message":"add i18next: migrate 57 files across 35 features\n\nIntroduce i18next alongside @canvas/i18n as a parallel\ntranslation system. Migrate simple features (no interpolation,\nno pluralization, no class components) from createI18nScope/\nI18n.t to useTranslation/t.\n\nInfrastructure:\n- ui/shared/i18next/ — @canvas/i18next package wrapping\n  i18next + react-i18next with Canvas-specific config\n- scripts/extract-i18next-strings.js — extracts t() calls\n  from source into packages/translations/lib/canvas-lms/en.json\n- scripts/inherit-i18next-translations.js — bootstraps locale\n  files from existing config/locales/*.yml translations\n- build/new-jenkins/package-translations/ — sync config for\n  new canvas-lms-ui S3 project, cleanup for i18next format\n- ui/engine/capabilities/I18n/ — loads i18next locale bundles\n  via dynamic import alongside existing translation loading\n\n311 keys across 42 namespaces, 46 locale files with inherited\ntranslations. Old and new systems coexist at runtime.\n\nrefs CFA-810\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- yarn test for all migrated features passes (64 files, 493 tests)\n- set user locale to Spanish, visit account settings\n- verify \"Vista previa\" renders (i18next + inherited translation)\n- verify other Spanish strings on page still work (@canvas/i18n)\n\nChange-Id: I2cb2e1305b6e69c1eee28ba4aebeaec3fcea1e16\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407262\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Aaron Shafovaloff <ashafovaloff@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Aaron Shafovaloff <ashafovaloff@instructure.com>\nBuild-Review: James Butters <jbutters@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Cameron Ray <c