es\" is light blue\n- Click \"Choose from Canvas files\" — verify modal Cancel is light blue\n- Submit the empty form — verify validation errors appear\n- Fill required fields and save — verify redirect to show page\n- Verify the new chat is in unpublished state\n- Open a published chat, click Edit, change a field, click Save\n- Verify the chat remains published after saving\n- Click Edit again, click Cancel — verify no changes were saved\n- On the show page, verify \"View conversations\" is light blue\n- Open a chat as a student, get a response, click thumbs-down\n- Verify the \"Skip\" button is light blue\n\nChange-Id: I3a69193401bb91b6e817da4e9daee8b8431a8c03\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407244\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Caleb Guanzon <cguanzon@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jason Anderson <jason.anderson@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"762ff808aa50b2479fb94c9cc582dfa36d1015d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/762ff808aa50b2479fb94c9cc582dfa36d1015d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/b1d9d4e2681b86a36f069407fc5b682e4cf0ccd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4731070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cguanzon","id":4731070,"login":"cguanzon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzEwNzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cguanzon/received_eve