er_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/62a1355ffab2b1422c3be18a0afdb8d04362680b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T20:20:49Z","email":"jbutters@instructure.com","name":"James Butters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T15:51:46Z","email":"jbutters@instructure.com","name":"James Butters"},"message":"fix flaky NewStudentGroupModal test again\n\nflag=none\n\nThe ''fetches and reports status'' test is flaky because\nfindByRole(''option'', {name: ''Student''}) cannot reliably\nresolve the accessible name on InstUI''s nested option\nmarkup (<li role=\"none\"><span role=\"option\">Student</span>).\n\nSwitch to findByText(''Student''), which matches textContent\ndirectly and avoids the accessibility-tree resolution.\nAlso clear the React Query cache between tests to prevent\ncross-test pollution.\n\ntest plan:\n  - run the test 25+ times locally:\n    yarn test ui/shared/groups/react/__tests__/NewStudentGroupModal.test.jsx\n  - verify all runs pass\n  - verify Jenkins build passes\n\nChange-Id: I1ed8ed40b2f78067860944f82c28b4f2d27906ce\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407334\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Adrián Grúber <adrian.gruber@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: James Butters <jbutters@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: James Butters <jbutters@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"c50f00371fdbdaa1f6204ef189f4593a5685f862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/trees/c50f00371fdbdaa1f6204ef189f4593a5685f862"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/git/commits/62a1355ffab2b1422c3be18a0afdb8d04362680b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51923613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbutte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt