false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/June-eoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/June-eoh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/June-eoh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/bf605b677f144607de9ec9aaf31110598141fd08","node_id":"C_kwDOABQOD9oAKGJmNjA1YjY3N2YxNDQ2MDdkZTllYzlhYWYzMTExMDU5ODE0MWZkMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms/commit/0e7e71cc4673869bcb4ad1339093c90053c76745","sha":"0e7e71cc4673869bcb4ad1339093c90053c76745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/0e7e71cc4673869bcb4ad1339093c90053c76745"}],"sha":"bf605b677f144607de9ec9aaf31110598141fd08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/bf605b677f144607de9ec9aaf31110598141fd08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35575166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kaibjorkman","id":35575166,"login":"kaibjorkman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTc1MTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaibjorkman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/instructure/canvas-lms/commits/0e7e71cc4673869bcb4ad1339093c90053c76745/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T00:28:08Z","email":"kbjorkman@instructure.com","name":"Kai Bjorkman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T17:01:35Z","email":"kbjorkman@instructure.com","name":"Kai Bjorkman"},"message":"deduplicate quiz attempts in classic quizzes\n\nReturn one entry per attempt instead of one per version,\nso regraded attempts do not create duplicate dropdown\nentries in SpeedGrader 2. Also hardens the quiz history\ncontroller against any unrecognised ?version= param by\nraising 404 instead of silently falling back to the\ncurrent submission.\n\nfixes EVAL-6324\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- create a classic quiz with multiple attempts allowed\n- make a multiple choice question\n- take the quiz multiple times with each of the different answers\n- change the correct answer as the teacher after taking the quiz and\nforce a regrade\n- open the quiz in speedgrader and make sure there is an entry for each\n  attempt and no duplicates\n- select each attempt and make sure the iframe changes to show the\n  correct attempt\n- verify that the iframe shows the correct attempt for a regraded\nattempt\n- navigate directly to the quiz history URL in the browser with a valid\n  version number (e.g. /courses/:id/quizzes/:id/history?version=1) and\n  verify the correct attempt loads\n- navigate directly to the quiz history URL in the browser with a\nversion number outside the valid range (e.g. ?version=9999) and verify\nthe page returns 404\n\nChange-Id: I67c4d68ab3a569fb6dc5ad8d1d5275101dd2fcbd\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/407207\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Soto <christopher.soto@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Spencer Olson <solson@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Spencer Olson <solson@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Cameron Ray <cameron.ray@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Cameron Ray <cameron.ray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3e0245bf1aba143fb28aeb37e8c46324c56d386","url":"https://api